{{! Desktop entry template for dx bundle (Dioxus.toml: [bundle.deb]
    desktop_template). dx renders this for the deb, the rpm and the AppImage,
    so this one file carries the file association on every Linux package.

    It is dx's built-in template plus two things (FRE-114): `%f` on Exec, so a
    file manager passes the double-clicked path, and the MimeType line that
    makes hubro appear as a handler for SQLite databases at all. Keep the rest
    byte-for-byte identical to dx's default — anything dropped here is dropped
    from the shipped .desktop file.

    `%f` and not `%F`: hubro opens one database per window, and a `%F` launch
    with several files would be a usage error. }}
[Desktop Entry]
Categories={{categories}}
{{#if comment}}
Comment={{comment}}
{{/if}}
Exec={{exec}} %f
Icon={{icon}}
Name={{name}}
Terminal=false
Type=Application
MimeType=application/vnd.sqlite3;application/x-sqlite3;
